ntity.usehello.ai" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) bg-(--color-accent) text-(--color-accent-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_6px_16px_-6px_var(--shadow-tint)] inset-ring-1 inset-ring-white/15 hover:bg-(--color-accent-bright) hover:shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_10px_24px_-8px_var(--shadow-tint)] active:shadow-[0_1px_1px_var(--shadow-tint-strong)] h-12 px-6 text-base pr-4 group max-sm:w-full max-sm:whitespace-normal">Ship your first receipt<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-3 translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M4.5 2.5L8 6l-3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><a href="/book-a-review" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) border border-(--color-line-strong) bg-(--color-surface) text-(--color-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-contact)] hover:border-(--color-ink-faint) hover:bg-(--color-raised) active:shadow-none h-12 px-6 text-base  max-sm:w-full max-sm:whitespace-normal">Book a review</a></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm text-(--color-ink-muted)">Platform-neutral. Built for regulated and high-accountability workflows.</p></div></div><div class="rule-perforated absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10"></div></section><section id="flow" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-32 "><p class="text-caps mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-accent) "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-px w-7 bg-(--color-line-accent)"></span>Proof for the agent economy</p><h2 class="max-w-(--width-prose) text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Evidence-backed billing</h2><div class="mt-10"><div><p class="max-w-(--width-prose) text-lg leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">The Agent Work Receipt is evidence that work happened, was verified against policy, and is exactly what you are billed for. Every line item traces to its own proof-of-work receipt.</p><p class="mt-6 max-w-(--width-prose) leading-(--leading-relaxed)"><span class="text-(--color-ink)">Voice is one example.</span> <span class="text-(--color-accent)">Wherever AI does work, agents, assistants, copilots, or automations, it gets an Agent Work Receipt.</span></p><ul class="mt-16 grid items-start gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr] lg:gap-6"><li class="text-center"><img alt="" width="220" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fvoice_agent.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fvoice_agent.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fvoice_agent.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg">AI voice agent</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[28ch] text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Answers and acts for your practice, 24/7</p></li><li aria-hidden="true" class="hidden items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:flex"><span class="grid size-5 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-earned) text-(--color-canvas)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-4 text-(--color-ink-faint)"><path d="M4 12h14m0 0l-5-5m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></li><li class="text-center"><img alt="" width="220" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fwork.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fwork.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fwork.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg">Work</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[28ch] text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Workflows and tasks the agent completes</p><ul class="mx-auto mt-5 flex w-fit flex-col items-start gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="size-[1.125rem] shrink-0"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.75" y="4.25" width="14.5" height="13" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M2.75 8.25h14.5M6.5 2.75v3M13.5 2.75v3"></path><rect x="6" y="11" width="4" height="3" rx="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></rect></g></svg>Appointment booked</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="size-[1.125rem] shrink-0"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1.75" y="4.75" width="16.5" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M1.75 8.75h16.5"></path><rect x="4.5" y="11.5" width="4.5" height="1.75" rx="0.875" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></rect></g></svg>Payment collected</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="size-[1.125rem] shrink-0"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3.25" width="12" height="14" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M7.75 3.25V2.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h2.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v0.75z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M7.25 8.5h5.5M7.25 11.5h5.5M7.25 14.5h3"></path></g></svg>Patient intake</li></ul></li><li aria-hidden="true" class="hidden items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:flex"><span class="grid size-5 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-earned) text-(--color-canvas)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-4 text-(--color-ink-faint)"><path d="M4 12h14m0 0l-5-5m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></li><li class="text-center"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="220" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fagent_work_auditor.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fagent_work_auditor.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fagent_work_auditor.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg">Agent Work System</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[28ch] text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Verifies the work, checks compliance, and issues a sealed receipt</p></li><li aria-hidden="true" class="hidden items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:flex"><span class="grid size-5 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-earned) text-(--color-canvas)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="size-4 text-(--color-ink-faint)"><path d="M4 12h14m0 0l-5-5m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></li><li class="text-center"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="220" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-28 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fsafe_billing.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fsafe_billing.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fawr%2Fsafe_billing.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg">Safe billing</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[28ch] text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Every line traces to its receipt. Verifiable and undisputed.</p></li></ul><div data-surface="tint" class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-xl bg-transparent"><div class="[--color-surface:var(--color-canvas)]"><article aria-label="Example Agent Work Receipt" class="overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-lg) border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface)"><header class="border-b border-(--color-line) px-7 py-6"><p class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-(--tracking-tight)">Agent Work Receipt</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-(--color-ink-muted)">Agent Work System</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-(--radius-sm) border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors duration-(--duration-base) border-(--color-earned) text-(--color-earned)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-(--color-earned)"></span>Policy pass</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-(--radius-sm) border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors duration-(--duration-base) border-(--color-earned) text-(--color-earned)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-(--color-earned)"></span>Evidence complete</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-(--radius-sm) border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors duration-(--duration-base) border-(--color-earned) text-(--color-earned)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-(--color-earned)"></span>Billability earned</span></div></header><div class="px-7 pt-0 pb-5"><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Receipt ID</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">awr_rcpt_8f2c41d9e7</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Type</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">validated_work_event</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Lifecycle state</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">earned</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Work type</span><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">Workflows and Tasks</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Event</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">appointment_booked_with_deposit</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Policy result</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">pass</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Evidence</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">5 of 5</span></div></div><div class="border-t border-(--color-line) px-7 py-5"><div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6"><div><p class="text-caps text-(--color-ink)">Charge</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Meter M1<!-- --> · <!-- -->Trusted interaction</p></div><p data-numeric="true" class="text-2xl text-(--color-accent)">$1.50<!-- --> <span class="text-sm text-(--color-ink-subtle)">USD</span></p></div></div><div class="border-t border-(--color-line) px-7 py-5"><p class="text-caps text-(--color-ink)">Evidence manifest (<!-- -->5<!-- --> of <!-- -->5<!-- -->)</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-2 first:border-t-0"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">scheduler_appointment_id</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">SHA-256 <!-- -->b1c7e9a3...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-2 first:border-t-0"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">payment_processor_transaction_id</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">SHA-256 <!-- -->9f3a4d7c...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-2 first:border-t-0"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">payment_capture_status</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">SHA-256 <!-- -->2d5e7f01...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-2 first:border-t-0"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">confirmation_message_timestamp</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">SHA-256 <!-- -->7a6d2c3f...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-2 first:border-t-0"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">policy_scan_result</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">SHA-256 <!-- -->1e9b4c6d...</span></div></div></div><footer class="border-t border-(--color-line) px-7 py-6 transition-opacity duration-(--duration-base) opacity-100"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><span class="rounded-(--radius-sm) bg-(--color-accent) px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-(--tracking-caps) text-(--color-accent-ink) uppercase">Sealed</span><span class="text-sm text-(--color-ink-muted)">Cryptographically signed</span></div><div class="mt-5"><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Seal hash</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">a8d2f6e9c7b1d4a0...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Signature</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">ed25519 4f6a2b7c...</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Retention until</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">2029-06-29 · 3 years</span></div><div class="rule-hairline flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 py-2.5 first:border-t-0"><span class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">Jurisdiction</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink)">us-east-1</span></div></div></footer></article><div class="deal-sheet mx-5"><a class="group relative -mt-px block rounded-b-(--radius-lg) border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-7 py-4 transition-[transform,background-color,border-color] duration-(--duration-base) ease-(--ease-out-quint) hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-(--color-line-strong) hover:bg-(--color-raised) focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0" href="/statement"><span class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="size-[1.125rem] shrink-0 text-(--color-ink-subtle) transition-colors duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:text-(--color-accent)"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path class="deal-glyph" d="M6.5 4.75V3.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6.4l2.85 2.85v7.65a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.5"></path><path d="M3.75 6.75a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5.4l2.85 2.85v7.15a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-7.25a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"></path><path d="M6.25 11h5M6.25 13.5h3.25"></path></g></svg><span class="text-caps text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Where this receipt ends up</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-(--color-ink-faint) transition-[transform,color] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-(--color-accent) motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0"><path d="M3.75 10h12.5M11.25 5.25 16.25 10l-5 4.75" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm text-(--color-ink) underline decoration-(--color-line-strong) underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:decoration-(--color-accent)">The monthly statement</span></span></a></div></div></div><p class="mt-12 text-center"><span class="text-(--color-ink)"><strong class="font-normal">Tamper-evident. Verifiable. Defensible.</strong></span> <span class="text-(--color-ink-muted)">Built for audit, built for trust.</span></p><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-(--width-prose) text-center leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">AWR starts with voice agents in US healthcare, a<!-- --> <strong class="font-normal text-(--color-ink)">$5.4B to $8.5B</strong> <!-- -->market where every<!-- --> <strong class="font-normal text-(--color-ink)">unanswered patient call</strong> <!-- -->is lost revenue. Every recovered one gets an Agent Work Receipt.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="use-cases" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-14 "><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.78fr)_minmax(0,2.22fr)] lg:gap-14"><header><p class="text-caps mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-accent) "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-px w-7 bg-(--color-line-accent)"></span>Starting use cases</p><h2 class="max-w-(--width-prose) text-3xl text-balance sm:text-4xl">Where receipts earn their keep.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-[44ch] text-base leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Start with agents whose output changes a schedule, moves money, or ships code. AWR makes the work reviewable before it becomes a charge, decision, or liability.</p><p class="mt-8"><a href="#watch" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-(--color-accent) underline-offset-4 hover:underline">See how a receipt is created<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-3 translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M4.5 2.5L8 6l-3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></p></header><div><ul class="grid border-t border-(--color-line) md:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-b border-(--color-line) py-7 md:py-8 md:pr-7 "><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-(--color-ink-faint)">01</span><div class="mt-8"><h3 class="text-xl leading-(--leading-snug) font-light">AI voice operations</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Receipt the work completed across patient, customer, and revenue-critical conversations.</p></div><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Appointments, rescheduling, and cancellations</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Intake and insurance verification</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Payment collection during booking</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>No-show recovery and human handoff</li></ul><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-7"><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">completion</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">consent</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">handoff</span></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-b border-(--color-line) py-7 md:py-8 md:border-l md:pl-7 md:pr-7"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-(--color-ink-faint)">02</span><div class="mt-8"><h3 class="text-xl leading-(--leading-snug) font-light">Payment operations</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Create defensible records for agents that move money, correct errors, and resolve exceptions.</p></div><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Procurement and accounts payable</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Refunds, reversals, and corrections</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Disputes and chargebacks</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Settlement and reconciliation</li></ul><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-7"><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">authority</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">exception</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">settlement</span></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-b border-(--color-line) py-7 md:py-8 md:border-l md:pl-7 "><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-(--color-ink-faint)">03</span><div class="mt-8"><h3 class="text-xl leading-(--leading-snug) font-light">PR Review</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Preserve the standards, findings, remediation, and judgment behind agent-assisted releases.</p></div><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Pull request review runs</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Security, quality, and policy checks</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Findings, remediation, and re-review</li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 text-sm leading-(--leading-snug)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="mt-1 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M2 6.4 L4.6 9 L10 3.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Approval and merge recommendations</li></ul><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-7"><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">standards</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">findings</span><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.625rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-(--color-ink-muted)">decision</span></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section id="why" data-surface="tint" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-32 "><p class="text-caps mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-accent) "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-px w-7 bg-(--color-line-accent)"></span>The proof gap</p><h2 class="max-w-(--width-prose) text-3xl sm:text-4xl">AI usage is measurable.<span class="block">AI value usually is not.</span></h2><div class="mt-7"><p class="text-lg leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted) max-w-(--width-prose-wide)">You can meter AI consumption to the token. You still cannot reliably prove which AI work created value. The trust problem is no longer “did the model respond?” It is “did the agent actually complete the work, follow policy, and produce evidence we can defend in audit, dispute, or billing?”</p></div><div class="mt-14"><figure class="m-0" aria-label="Today, AI slop, retry cost, duplicate work, human correction and rejected output are billed alike as unverified work. AWR applies one test, on interaction, evidence, policy and defensible billing, and records the result as earned, duplicate suppressed, failed validation or non billable."><div data-surface="hero" class="mt-3"><div class="rule-perforated"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] overflow-hidden px-6 sm:px-9 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.3fr)_auto_minmax(0,0.8fr)] lg:gap-x-10"><div class="relative py-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-6 -right-5 bg-(--color-duplicate-wash) sm:-left-9"></span><span class="text-caps relative block text-(--color-ink-subtle)">AI usage</span><span class="relative mt-0.5 block text-sm text-(--color-ink)">Unverified work</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative hidden w-[21rem] lg:block"><span class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-5 -right-5"><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-(--color-duplicate-wash)" style="clip-path:polygon(0 0, calc(50% + 1.75rem) 0, 50% 100%, 0 100%)"></span><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-(--color-earned-wash)" style="clip-path:polygon(calc(50% + 1.75rem) 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 50% 100%)"></span></span></div><div class="relative py-3.5 lg:text-right"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-y-0 -right-6 -left-5 bg-(--color-earned-wash) sm:-right-9"></span><span class="text-caps relative block text-(--color-accent)">AI value</span><span class="relative mt-0.5 block text-sm text-(--color-ink)">Trusted event</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] items-center gap-x-10 gap-y-12 px-6 pt-9 pb-10 sm:px-9 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.3fr)_auto_minmax(0,0.8fr)]"><div><ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-6 lg:flex-nowrap lg:justify-start"><li class="flex w-[4.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) text-(--color-ink-subtle)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 8c2-3 4 3 7 0s5 3 7 0 M5 16c2-3 4 3 7 0s5 3 7 0"></path></svg></span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) font-medium text-(--color-ink-muted)">AI slop</span></li><li class="flex w-[4.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) text-(--color-ink-subtle)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a7 7 0 1 0 1 7 M18 4v4h-4"></path></svg></span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) font-medium text-(--color-ink-muted)">Retry cost</span></li><li class="flex w-[4.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) text-(--color-ink-subtle)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="2"></rect><rect x="10" y="4" width="10" height="10" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) font-medium text-(--color-ink-muted)">Duplicate work</span></li><li class="flex w-[4.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) text-(--color-ink-subtle)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 19 4-1 9-9-3-3-9 9-1 4Z M13 8l3 3"></path></svg></span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) font-medium text-(--color-ink-muted)">Human correction</span></li><li class="flex w-[4.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) text-(--color-ink-subtle)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><path d="m9 9 6 6 M15 9l-6 6"></path></svg></span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) font-medium text-(--color-ink-muted)">Rejected output</span></li></ul><p class="text-caps mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-(--color-ink) lg:justify-start"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h9l3 3v14l-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1V3Z"></path><path d="M9 8h6"></path><path d="M9 12h3"></path></svg>Billed alike</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-sm font-normal text-(--color-ink-faint)">AWR verifies the work</span><div class="relative mt-3 w-[21rem] max-w-full"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 h-px bg-(--color-line)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-px bg-(--color-line)"></span><div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8"><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) text-(--color-ink) text-right">Interaction</span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) text-(--color-ink) ">Policy</span><div class="col-span-2 flex justify-center py-3.5"><span class="relative grid size-[9.5rem] place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-line-strong) bg-(--color-accent-wash)"><span class="grid size-[6.5rem] place-items-center rounded-full border border-(--color-accent) bg-(--color-canvas)"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-lg font-normal tracking-(--tracking-tight) text-(--color-accent)">AWR</span></span></span></div><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) text-(--color-ink) text-right">Evidence</span><span class="text-xs leading-(--leading-snug) text-(--color-ink) ">Defensible billing</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-6 h-8 w-px bg-(--color-line-strong) lg:hidden"></span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:items-end"><ul class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-ink-muted)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 shrink-0 bg-(--color-ink-subtle)"></span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-sm">duplicate_suppressed</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-ink-muted)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 shrink-0 bg-(--color-ink-subtle)"></span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-sm">failed_validation</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-ink-muted)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 shrink-0 bg-(--color-ink-subtle)"></span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-sm">non_billable</span></li></ul><div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-lg text-(--color-ink-muted)">AWR</span><span data-numeric="true" class="text-lg font-normal text-(--color-earned)">earned</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-earned) ring-4 ring-(--color-earned-wash)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-6"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-canvas)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></div><span class="text-caps mt-2.5 text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Billable</span></div></div><div class="rule-perforated"></div></div><figcaption class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-end gap-2 text-sm text-(--color-ink)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-(--color-earned)" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.75 4.75 5.5v5.9c0 4.4 3 7.6 7.25 9.85 4.25-2.25 7.25-5.45 7.25-9.85V5.5Z"></path><path d="m9 11.8 2.2 2.2L15.2 10"></path></svg>AWR makes the trusted event the center of the system.</figcaption></figure></div><dl class="mt-8 grid max-w-[62rem] gap-x-12 gap-y-9 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><dt data-numeric="true" class="shrink-0 text-4xl leading-none text-(--color-accent)">85%</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">of organizations that can see their full AI cost still cannot demonstrate established ROI.</dd></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5"><dt data-numeric="true" class="shrink-0 text-4xl leading-none text-(--color-accent)">97%</dt><dd class="text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">of organizations without that visibility cannot demonstrate it either.</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-9 max-w-(--width-prose) text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">Source: KPMG Global AI Pulse Q2 2026, 2,145 senior leaders across 20 countries. In the same survey, 35% report AI operating costs that are fully visible and actively monitored, 29% report difficulty controlling those costs as systems scale, and 40% have a usage or token budget in place.</p></div></section><section id="why-close" data-surface="tint" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-14 "><div class="grid items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-7 sm:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" class="size-16 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="60" cy="112" rx="30" ry="4.5" fill="#0d2436" opacity="0.08"></ellipse><g stroke="#0d2436" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="24" y="20" width="72" height="80" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"></rect><rect x="34" y="30" width="26" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#7cc4f8" stroke="none"></rect><path d="M34 47 h24" stroke="#7cc4f8" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M36 84 L52 66 L64 76 L84 56" fill="none" stroke="#1c4f7c"></path><path d="M72 56 h12 v12" fill="none" stroke="#1c4f7c"></path><g><circle cx="92" cy="94" r="15" fill="#2bb3a3" stroke="#0d2436" stroke-width="3"></circle><path d="M85 94 l5 5 l9 -10" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></g></svg><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-base leading-(--leading-tight) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-tight) text-(--color-ink) sm:text-lg">Stop measuring AI activity as productivity. Prove which AI work earns the right to scale.</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">AWR turns “trust us” into “<a class="font-medium text-(--color-accent) underline decoration-(--color-line-accent) underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-(--duration-fast) hover:decoration-(--color-accent) focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent)" href="/statement">here is the receipt</a>.”</p></div><div class="flex sm:col-span-2 sm:justify-start lg:col-span-1 lg:justify-end"><a href="/economics/calculator" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) bg-(--color-accent) text-(--color-accent-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_6px_16px_-6px_var(--shadow-tint)] inset-ring-1 inset-ring-white/15 hover:bg-(--color-accent-bright) hover:shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_10px_24px_-8px_var(--shadow-tint)] active:shadow-[0_1px_1px_var(--shadow-tint-strong)] h-12 px-6 text-base pr-4 group max-sm:w-full max-sm:whitespace-normal">Run your own numbers<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-3 translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M4.5 2.5L8 6l-3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id="watch" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-32 "><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] lg:items-end lg:gap-14"><div><p class="text-caps mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-accent) "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-px w-7 bg-(--color-line-accent)"></span>From action to invoice</p><h2 class="max-w-(--width-prose) text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Every charge must survive the proof.</h2></div><p class="text-lg leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted) max-w-(--width-prose)">AWR captures the action, verifies its evidence and policy, decides billability, and carries only earned work into the customer statement.</p></div><div class="mt-10"><div><div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-xl) border border-(--color-line) lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1.08fr]"><section aria-label="Capture" class="bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-6"><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-caps text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Capture</p><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">01–02</span></div><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">01</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Action captured</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">received</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Source, payload, and execution context are retained exactly as received.</p></div></article><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">02</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Classified</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">classified</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Work type, event key, and carried data classes are assigned.</p></div></article></section><section aria-label="Verify" data-surface="tint" class="bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-6"><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-caps text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Verify</p><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">03–04</span></div><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">03</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Evidence checked</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">candidate_billable</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Required artifacts and duplicate conditions are checked against the rule.</p></div></article><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">04</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Policy applied</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">validated</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Runtime policy produces a retained verdict, including every failure.</p></div></article></section><section aria-label="Decide" data-surface="hero" class="bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-6"><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-caps text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Decide</p><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-faint)">05–06</span></div><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">05</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Billability decided</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">earned</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">One decision separates earned work from work that cannot be charged.</p></div></article><div class="my-2 grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 rounded-(--radius-lg) bg-(--color-ink) px-4 py-3.5"><div><p class="text-base leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal text-(--color-canvas)">Earned work continues.</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-canvas) opacity-80">Everything else exits with a named reason.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-(--radius-md) bg-(--color-earned)"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-5"><path d="M2.5 6.2 L4.8 8.5 L9.5 3.6" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-canvas)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></div><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">06</span><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Decision sealed</h3><span data-numeric="true" class="rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-(--color-ink-muted)">posted_to_ledger</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">The result is signed, retained, and independently verifiable.</p></div></article><p data-numeric="true" class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">duplicate_suppressed<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->failed_validation<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->non_billable</p></section></div><div class="mt-3 grid overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-lg) border border-(--color-line) lg:grid-cols-[minmax(10.5rem,0.55fr)_1.35fr_1fr]"><div data-surface="hero" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-5"><span class="text-caps text-(--color-ink-subtle)">Bill it</span><strong class="text-lg leading-(--leading-snug) font-light">Proof becomes a charge.</strong></div><article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-5"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">07</span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Statement assembled</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted)">Earned work aggregates by billing period, with proof attached to every charge line.</p><div class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-normal text-(--color-ink)">AWR prices it</span><span class="rounded-full bg-(--color-surface) px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-normal text-(--color-ink)">You price it</span></div></div></article><article data-surface="tint" class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 bg-(--color-canvas) px-6 py-5"><span data-numeric="true" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-(--color-raised) text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">08</span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm leading-(--leading-snug) font-normal">Invoice handed off</h3><p class="mt-2.5 text-xs font-normal text-(--color-ink-subtle)">AWR boundary → payment provider</p></div></article></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-end"><a href="/statement" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) border border-(--color-line-strong) bg-(--color-surface) text-(--color-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-contact)] hover:border-(--color-ink-faint) hover:bg-(--color-raised) active:shadow-none h-12 px-6 text-base  max-sm:w-full max-sm:whitespace-normal">See the billed statement</a><a href="https://identity.usehello.ai" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) bg-(--color-accent) text-(--color-accent-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_6px_16px_-6px_var(--shadow-tint)] inset-ring-1 inset-ring-white/15 hover:bg-(--color-accent-bright) hover:shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_10px_24px_-8px_var(--shadow-tint)] active:shadow-[0_1px_1px_var(--shadow-tint-strong)] h-12 px-6 text-base pr-4 group max-sm:w-full max-sm:whitespace-normal">Ship your first receipt<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-3 translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M4.5 2.5L8 6l-3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="anatomy" data-surface="tint" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-(--height-nav)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) left-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="top:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);bottom:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 w-px bg-(--color-grid) right-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="right:calc(50% - 50cqi);width:max(0px, calc((100cqi - 100%) / 2 - var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2))" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid-page) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2);right:calc(var(--size-grid-dot-gap) / 2)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-px bg-(--color-grid) top-0"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-grid-dot="top" style="width:var(--size-grid-dot);height:var(--size-grid-dot)" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-10 top-0 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-grid-dot)"></span><div class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-32 "><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16"><div><p class="text-caps mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-(--color-accent) "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-px w-7 bg-(--color-line-accent)"></span>The receipt primitive</p><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">The product is the evidence object.</h2><div class="mt-7"><p class="text-lg leading-(--leading-relaxed) text-(--color-ink-muted) max-w-(--width-prose)">An Agent Work Receipt is not a log, trace, audit trail, or usage record. Those are inputs. The receipt is the durable unit of truth that shows who acted, who authorized it, what work happened, what it cost, what evidence exists, whether it is billable, and whether it can be accepted, disputed, audited, exported, settled, scored, or handed off.</p></div><div class="mt-9"><a href="https://identity.usehello.ai" class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-(--radius-md) font-medium tracking-(--tracking-normal) transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-(--duration-fast) ease-(--ease-out-quint) active:translate-y-px focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-(--color-accent) bg-(--color-accent) text-(--color-accent-ink) shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_6px_16px_-6px_var(--shadow-tint)] inset-ring-1 inset-ring-white/15 hover:bg-(--color-accent-bright) hover:shadow-[0_1px_2px_var(--shadow-tint-strong),0_10px_24px_-8px_var(--shadow-tint)] active:shadow-[0_1px_1px_var(--shadow-tint-strong)] h-12 px-6 text-base pr-4 group">Ship your first receipt<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="size-3 translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M4.5 2.5L8 6l-3.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="rounded-(--radius-lg) border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-surface) overflow-hidden"><div data-surface="hero" class="bg-(--color-canvas)"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-(--color-line) px-7 py-4"><span data-numeric="true" class="text-xs text-(--color-ink-muted)">POST<!-- --> <!-- -->/v1/events</span